{
  "name": "PCMSO - Lote assíncrono (Excel para revisão)",
  "_nota": "App de EXTRAÇÃO roda na porta 8000 (uvicorn src.api.main:app). Fase 3: POST /extrair-lote é assíncrono e devolve {job_uuid}. O acompanhamento agora é por POLLING EXPLÍCITO de status (GET /lote/{uuid}), NÃO mais por retryOnFail no download: um nó GET status alimenta dois IFs (concluido -> baixa Excel; falhou -> notifica erro com erro_detalhe; senão -> espera 30s e volta ao status). Isso elimina o problema antigo de esgotar 20 tentativas em 422. Garanta que o worker está rodando (scripts/worker_lote.py em loop, ou cron --once). Dois gatilhos: cron mensal (dia 1, 07h) e webhook manual (POST /webhook/upload-pcmso-lote) para o analista disparar fora do cron. URLs usam host.docker.internal pois o n8n roda em Docker e precisa alcançar os apps no host.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": { "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 7 1 * *" }] } },
      "id": "trigger-mensal",
      "name": "Gatilho mensal (1o dia 07h)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [240, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "httpMethod": "POST", "path": "upload-pcmso-lote", "options": {} },
      "id": "trigger-webhook",
      "name": "Gatilho manual (webhook)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [240, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "fileSelector": "data/pcmso_raw/*.pdf", "options": {} },
      "id": "read-pdfs",
      "name": "Ler PDFs da pasta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "position": [460, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/extrair-lote",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "name": "files", "inputDataFieldName": "data" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-extrair-lote",
      "name": "Extrair Lote (cria job)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [680, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "amount": 30, "unit": "seconds" },
      "id": "wait-poll",
      "name": "Aguardar 30s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [900, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=http://host.docker.internal:8000/lote/{{ $json.job_uuid }}",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "json" } } }
      },
      "id": "http-status",
      "name": "Consultar status do job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1120, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [{ "value1": "={{ $json.status }}", "operation": "equal", "value2": "concluido" }]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-concluido",
      "name": "Concluído?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [1340, 320]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [{ "value1": "={{ $json.status }}", "operation": "equal", "value2": "falhou" }]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-falhou",
      "name": "Falhou?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [1340, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=http://host.docker.internal:8000/lote/{{ $json.job_uuid }}/excel",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "file" } } }
      },
      "id": "http-download-excel",
      "name": "Baixar Excel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1560, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "write",
        "fileName": "data/pcmso_lote/PCMSO_Lote_{{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}.xlsx",
        "dataPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "save-excel",
      "name": "Salvar Excel p/ analista",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "position": [1780, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { tipo: 'lote_pronto', mensagem: 'Lote extraído (assíncrono). Revise o Excel (aba Metadados traz status de duplicata/versão) e suba em /converter-excel.' } }];"
      },
      "id": "fn-notif-lote",
      "name": "Notificar - Lote pronto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [2000, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { tipo: 'lote_falhou', mensagem: `Lote ${$json.job_uuid} FALHOU: ${$json.erro_detalhe || 'erro sistêmico'}. Verifique o worker e o diretório de staging.` } }];"
      },
      "id": "fn-notif-erro",
      "name": "Notificar - Lote falhou",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [1560, 500]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Gatilho mensal (1o dia 07h)": { "main": [[{ "node": "Ler PDFs da pasta", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Gatilho manual (webhook)":    { "main": [[{ "node": "Ler PDFs da pasta", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Ler PDFs da pasta":           { "main": [[{ "node": "Extrair Lote (cria job)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Extrair Lote (cria job)":     { "main": [[{ "node": "Aguardar 30s", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Aguardar 30s":                { "main": [[{ "node": "Consultar status do job", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Consultar status do job":     { "main": [[{ "node": "Concluído?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Concluído?": { "main": [
      [{ "node": "Baixar Excel", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
      [{ "node": "Falhou?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
    ]},
    "Falhou?": { "main": [
      [{ "node": "Notificar - Lote falhou", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
      [{ "node": "Aguardar 30s", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
    ]},
    "Baixar Excel":               { "main": [[{ "node": "Salvar Excel p/ analista", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Salvar Excel p/ analista":   { "main": [[{ "node": "Notificar - Lote pronto", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  }
}
